Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5\fscx65\fscy65}The England subs brought on only for\NPENALTIES
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.31,0:00:03.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Back in 2021,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.53,0:00:04.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}England played Italy
