Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.69,0:00:37.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Then came Sancho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:38.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Donnarumma saved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.49,0:00:38.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}England
